1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,820
The Latvian Gambit throws the f pawn forward immediately.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,720
White accepts and attacks the pawn with the knight.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,620
Black brings the queen out before the king can castle.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,520
White builds a center and keeps the initiative.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,420
The queen slides toward the king instead of retreating.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,320
One bishop move removes the last defensive tempo.

7
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,220
The queen reaches g two and the king is exposed.
